    title: "[Longevity Lane + Liver-Aging Regulatory Logic + Lifespan-Resolved RNA-ATAC Multi-Omic Atlas + Sex-Resolved Senotype Emergence + Transient Female-Specific Ascl1 Pioneer-Factor Pulse] GSE341532 'A lifespan-resolved multi-omic study reveals dynamic transcription factor networks and the regulatory logic of liver aging [ChIP-seq]' (Mus musculus, score 7, n=12, pdat 2026/10/05, raw_file_availability yes, license NCBI public repository, SubSeries of GSE341533, query 'aging muscle atlas') is the FIRST NOVEL lifespan-resolved liver-aging regulatory-logic dataset of the day; [AI Drug Discovery Lane + Function-to-Transcriptome Workflow + 3D Matrigel Droplet Microfluidic Screening Platform + Engineered MSLN-CAR CIML NK Cells + Candidate lncRNAs Prioritized by Genomic Proximity and Co-Expression] GSE343647 'A High-Throughput Functional 3D Droplet Microfluidic Platform for Function-to-Transcriptome Profiling Identifies Candidate lncRNAs Associated with Engineered NK Cell Function' (Homo sapiens, score 6, n=12, pdat 2026/10/28 = FRESHEST NOVEL accession of the day, raw_file_availability yes, license NCBI public repository, query 'tumor metabolism single-cell') is the FIRST NOVEL function-first lncRNA-nomination dataset of the day; [Clinical & Regulatory Lane + Gamma-Delta T Cell Immunotherapy + QUAIL-100 Quadruple-Attenuated Listeria monocytogenes + Multimodal Activation Versus Zoledronic-Acid-Induced Terminal Differentiation and Exhaustion + Post-HSCT Pediatric Leukemia] GSE352026 'QUAIL-100 Induces Distinct, Multifunctional γδ T Cell Responses with Enhanced Durability Compared to Zoledronic Acid in Post-HSCT Pediatric Leukemia Patients' (Homo sapiens, score 6, n=21, pdat 2026/10/28 = FRESHEST NOVEL accession of the day, raw_file_availability yes, license NCBI public repository, query 'tumor metabolism single-cell') is the FIRST NOVEL bacterial-vector γδ T cell activator dataset of the day",
